As you are deciding what to do next, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> suddenly realizes the time and sighs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I got to get home. Curfew, and all that.”</span> He sighs again, you can tell he is more than a little bored. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I had- uh… I had fun though! We should… we should hang out again! Haha…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> says in an awkward tone. It is hard for him to hide his disappointment in today’s events. <span style="color:LightCoral">Trying not to make things too awkward, you nod and say goodbye, feeling a little bad to have not given the boy a fun time.</span><br>
<<socialChange "Lucas" -3>>
